Validate your licence key and set up your application. See sample code to learn how to install your AG Charts Enterprise product.

{% licenseSetup /%}

{% note %}
You do not need a license key to test AG Charts Enterprise locally, but you will see a watermark and error message in the console. If you want to remove these or test in production, you can [request a trial license](./community-vs-enterprise/#request-an-enterprise-bundle-trial-license).
{% /note %}
